{"id": "t098-001", "text": "dana's mum has her hip op sometime next week, dana staying w her for a few days afterwards. remind me to text dana the day after. she said her mum's been in pain for 2 yrs and kept putting it off cos of her dad being ill, so this is a big deal for both of them. dana's brother Bilal is meant to be helping too but he's in dubai till the end of the month", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying w her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text dana", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in pain", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 yrs"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "ill", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bilal", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in dubai", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the end of th