{"id": "t098-002", "text": "chantal got made redundant fri. whole team gone, 12 of them, no warning, just a teams call at 9am and laptops collected that afternoon. she's putting a brave face on but def not ok. she's got 3 months pay and is thinking of finally doing the garden design course she always talks abt, maybe starting in early march. her partner Emre is being really supportive. should meet her for coffee sometime next wk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chantal", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon"}, {"id": "f0", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "garden design course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early march", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "meet her for coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t098-005", "text": "rin and her gf split up after 5 yrs. she's moving out this wk and staying at her sister's for now, prob till the end of the month while she looks for a room. they're sharing custody of the dog Olive which is apparently the hardest bit. she's been signed off work for a wk. said she just wants to be distracted so maybe invite her to the quiz thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gf", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 5 yrs"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this wk", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the end of the month"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Olive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a wk", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to be distracted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her to the quiz", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiz", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "e4"}]}
