{"id": "t098-041", "text": "mai's leaving do is fri, she's moving to tokyo early march for 2 yrs!! job transfer w the bank. her bf rin is staying here for now and joining her over the summer once his contract ends. she's excited but terrified abt finding a flat out there, apparently viewings are a nightmare. need to get her a card + something small she can pack, she mentioned wanting a decent travel pillow", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early march", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 yrs", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job transfer w the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bf", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rin", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joining her", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "once his contract ends", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified abt finding a flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a card + something small she can pack", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent travel pillow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t098-044", "text": "amy's back at work mon after the op, phased return. remind me to check how she's getting on end of the wk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "mon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how she's getting on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t098-045", "text": "long call w hemi tonight. he's back from nz, the funeral was hard but he's glad he went. his nan was the one who taught him to fish so they all went out on the boat the day after and scattered her ashes. he's thinking of going back over the summer to spend time w his grandad who's on his own now. sounded tired but ok. should invite him for dinner sometime next week, maybe w amara and lior", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from nz", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "glad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scattered her ashes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on his own", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "amara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
